  "description": "DRIT.Presentation is a pure-managed, cross-platform .NET library for creating, reading, and manipulating PowerPoint presentations (PPTX, PPTM, PPSX, PPSM, and ODP). It offers presentation processing capabilities including slides, charts, SmartArt, shapes, animations, transitions, media, digital signatures, AES-256 encryption, VBA macros, and PDF, image, SVG, and HTML export.",
